sequenceDiagram
    participant Engine
    participant SceneManager
    participant OldScene
    participant NewScene
    participant Systems
    participant World

    Engine->>SceneManager: switchScene(name) / pushScene(name) / popScene()
    SceneManager->>SceneManager: collect active systems
    SceneManager->>Systems: deactivate systems leaving the stack
    SceneManager->>OldScene: exit()
    SceneManager->>World: remove(oldScene.world)
    SceneManager->>World: merge(newScene.world)
    SceneManager->>NewScene: enter()
    SceneManager->>Systems: activate systems for new stack
    SceneManager->>Systems: afterSceneChange(oldScene, newScene)
